{
  "about": [
    "Invented charts for the .hor reader's tests. tools/make-hor-fixtures.py writes each one into fixtures/morinus/ with",
    "every protocol listed, the way Morinus's save() does: 27 pickle.dump calls, one per field, in this order.",
    "morinusUtc is the UT Morinus itself gives, as a Gregorian date: chart.Time from Morinus 9.6.4",
    "(github.com/shin10567/Morinus-Source-Codes at bbe3ebe), run with its time-basis fields as subLoad passes",
    "them (longitude seconds as 0), on the Swiss Ephemeris extension of Morinus SE (github.com/IngenieriaAstrologica/Morinus",
    "at 020492d) built for Python 3.9.9 on arm64. null where the year is BC. Computed once on 2026-11-01; not rerun by the tests."
  ],
